### list stations I can access

GET {{BASE_URL}}/stations?accessible=true&page=1&per_page=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.cookies.access_token.value}}

### list stations (public)

GET {{BASE_URL}}/stations?page=1&per_page=10

### get station

GET {{BASE_URL}}/stations/{{STATION_ID}}

### station observations (session)

GET {{BASE_URL}}/stations/{{STATION_ID}}/observations?page=1&per_page=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.cookies.access_token.value}}

### station observations (API key)

GET {{BASE_URL}}/stations/{{STATION_ID}}/observations?page=1&per_page=10&api_key={{API_KEY}}
